1.2. "Contribution" means software supplied by a Contributor under this
License.

1.3. "Covered Software" means source code identified as licensed under
PAPL, executable versions of that code, and modifications to that code.

1.4. "Source Code Form" means the preferred form for making changes.

1.5. "Executable Form" means any form other than Source Code Form.

1.6. "Modification" means a change to a Covered Software file or a new
file containing Covered Software code.

1.7. "Larger Work" means a work combining Covered Software with other
material in separate files.

1.8. "You" means a person or legal entity exercising rights under this
License.

1.9. "Proprietor" means Luca Helgert.

1.10. "Spiritual Property" means the fictional concept of a soul or
metaphysical essence; it does not denote property recognized by law.

